<item><title>DA weighs mayoral swap as Johannesburg coalition talks stall</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/da-weighs-mayoral-swap-as-johannesburg-coalition-talks-stall-8dfaec/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/za/da-weighs-mayoral-swap-as-johannesburg-coalition-talks-stall-8dfaec/</guid><category>South Africa</category><description>The proposal would send party leader Geordin Hill-Lewis to Johannesburg and Helen Zille to Cape Town, but Zille says she is not taking it seriously.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:47:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" length="36666" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/za.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
